{"id":"wb-5-218","name":"涿州双塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"涿州双塔","text":"涿州双塔位于中国河北省涿州市城内北部，包括云居寺塔和智度寺塔，均为八角楼阁式仿木结构砖塔，两者相距约250米，1982年分别被列为河北省文物保护单位，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n云居寺塔建于辽大安八年（1160年），高55.7米。智度寺塔亦建于辽代，高44米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B6%BF%E5%B7%9E%E5%8F%8C%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85514105,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85514105","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/415749021ebba32431a09140.jpg","title":"云居寺塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%91%E5%B1%85%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/%E4%BA%91%E5%B1%85%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Redpipe","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNHE-312-135","width":320,"height":481}}